[h1]GK2 Vanilla+ – Ultrawide, Performance & Quality of Life[/h1]
[i]The game stays vanilla: no gameplay changes, no game files touched, saves stay compatible.[/i]
[b]English[/b] · [b]Deutsch weiter unten[/b]

[h2]New in 1.4[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Pin recipes, blueprints, quests[/b] – mouse or controller (both sticks), saved per save
[*][b]Save overview[/b] in the main menu, [b]Mods button[/b] in main and pause menu
[*][b]Graphics benchmark[/b] with score and recommendation
[*][b]Camera[/b]: zoom presets (F5), zoom indoors, mouse-wheel zoom
[*][b]Screenshots[/b] (F12) in up to 4× resolution without HUD
[*][b]6 languages[/b], high contrast, adjustable UI size, "What's new" after updates
[*]Week plan, daily reminder, save backups, hide HUD, in-game time in the FPS display
[/list]

[h2]Highlights[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Ultrawide 21:9 / 32:9[/b] – 2560×1080, 3440×1440, 3840×1080, 5120×1440 and more. The main menu fills the whole screen.
[*][b]More FPS on any PC[/b] – the mod menu ([b]F9[/b] or [b]Mods[/b]) exposes hidden graphics switches: shadows, ambient occlusion, point lights, back light, water, clouds, render mode. Plus FPS cap / VSync and physics rate. Great for laptops, handhelds and Macs.
[*][b]Graphics benchmark[/b] – one click tests all graphics tiers and recommends one. Your settings stay untouched.
[*][b]Pinning[/b] – recipes, blueprints, town buildings, blockages and quests. The list shows have / need per ingredient or the current quest task.
[*][b]Week plan[/b] ([b]F6[/b]) and a daily reminder – what's on which weekday. Spoiler-free: only what you have unlocked.
[*][b]FPS display[/b] ([b]F10[/b]) – corner and contents selectable: FPS, 1% low, CPU, GPU, RAM, VRAM, clock, in-game weekday and time.
[*][b]Saves & backups[/b] – save overview in the main menu, automatic backups (outside Steam Cloud) with one-click restore, "Save now", extra autosave.
[*][b]Camera & screenshots[/b] – zoom presets, zoom indoors, mouse wheel; hi-res screenshots.
[*][b]Hide HUD[/b] ([b]F7[/b]), pause in background, skip intro logos.
[*]Mod menu in the game's own look: English, German, French, Spanish, Russian, Chinese (more via a text file). One-click updates.
[/list]

[h2]Install (Windows)[/h2]
[olist]
[*]Click [b]Subscribe[/b] and wait until Steam has downloaded it.
[*]Open [i]<Steam library>\steamapps\workshop\content\4358690\<ID>[/i] (<ID> = number at the end of this page's address).
[*]Double-click [b]Installieren.bat[/b] (SmartScreen: "More info" → "Run anyway") → [b]Install[/b].
[*]Start the game, press [b]F9[/b] or click [b]Mods[/b].
[/olist]
Includes BepInEx 5.4.23.5. [b]Updates:[/b] mod menu → [b]Save & update[/b]. [b]Uninstall:[/b] Installieren.bat → [b]Uninstall[/b].
[b]Mac (CrossOver) / Linux (Proton):[/b] copy [i]installer\files[/i] into the game folder, DLL override [i]winhttp=n,b[/i].

[h2]Mod packs & license[/h2]
You may include GK2 Vanilla+ [b]unmodified[/b] in free mod packs, with credit ("GK2 Vanilla+ by McFly7"). Modifying it, re-uploading it as your own or removing credits is not allowed.
Source & releases: [url=https://github.com/Matshio7/gk2-vanilla-plus]github.com/Matshio7/gk2-vanilla-plus[/url] · Problems? Comment and attach [i]BepInEx\LogOutput.log[/i].
Pinning and daily reminder inspired by "Recipe Pin" (farfars) and "Daily Reminder" (MrsKiraSayers) – own implementation.

[hr][/hr]

[h1]Deutsch[/h1]
[i]Das Spiel bleibt Vanilla: kein anderes Gameplay, keine Spieldateien verändert, Spielstände bleiben kompatibel.[/i]

[h2]Highlights[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Ultrawide 21:9 / 32:9[/b] – Hauptmenü füllt den ganzen Bildschirm.
[*][b]Mehr FPS[/b] – versteckte Grafik-Schalter im Mod-Menü ([b]F9[/b] oder [b]Mods[/b]), FPS-Limit/VSync, Physik-Takt.
[*][b]Grafik-Benchmark[/b] mit Score und Empfehlung.
[*][b]Anpinnen[/b] – Rezepte, Baupläne, Stadtgebäude, Hindernisse und Quests, pro Spielstand gespeichert; Controller: beide Sticks.
[*][b]Wochenplan[/b] ([b]F6[/b]) und Tagesübersicht am Morgen – spoilerfrei.
[*][b]FPS-Anzeige[/b] ([b]F10[/b]) – Ecke und Inhalt wählbar, auch Wochentag und Uhrzeit im Spiel.
[*][b]Spielstände[/b] – Übersicht im Hauptmenü, Backups mit Wiederherstellen per Klick, „Jetzt speichern“, Autosave.
[*][b]Kamera & Screenshots[/b] – Zoom-Stufen (F5), Innenraum-Zoom, Mausrad-Zoom; F12 für Screenshots bis 4-fache Auflösung.
[*][b]HUD ausblenden[/b] ([b]F7[/b]), 6 Sprachen, hoher Kontrast, einstellbare Größe, Updates mit einem Klick.
[/list]

[h2]Installation (Windows)[/h2]
[b]Abonnieren[/b] → Item-Ordner [i]steamapps\workshop\content\4358690\<ID>[/i] öffnen → [b]Installieren.bat[/b] doppelklicken → [b]Installieren[/b]. Im Spiel [b]F9[/b] drücken oder [b]Mods[/b] klicken.

Weitergabe in kostenlosen Modpacks [b]unverändert[/b] und mit Namensnennung erlaubt, Verändern nicht. Details: [url=https://github.com/Matshio7/gk2-vanilla-plus/blob/main/LICENSE.md]LICENSE[/url]

[i]Fan project, not affiliated with Lazy Bear Games or tinyBuild.[/i]
